<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby Union-Super 12 results/standings.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union-Super 12 results/standings.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and standings after round 10 of the super 12 rugby union tournament.</p>
<p>    Wellington	   19   New South Wales  3</p>
<p>    Queensland	   40   Natal		3</p>
<p>    Northern Transvaal 23   Canterbury	 22</p>
<p>    Waikato		47   Gauteng Lions    9</p>
<p>    Auckland	     45   Otago		28</p>
<p>Standings(tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, points for, points against, bonus points, total points :   1. Auckland		9   8   1   0   356   221    6    40</p>
<p>  2. Wellington	    9   6   0   3   345   234    7    31</p>
